<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="dark">
    <meta name="_csrf" content="{{_csrf.token}}">
    <meta name="_csrf_header" content="{{_csrf.headerName}}">
    <title>SubFlow - 설정</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/variable/pretendardvariable-dynamic-subset.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/app.css?v=20261125r">
</head>
<body class="sf-auth-body">
<main class="sf-auth-card sf-auth-card-wide">
    <div class="sf-settings-head">
        <h1 class="sf-auth-brand">설정</h1>
        <div class="sf-settings-actions">
            {{#authEnabled}}
            <form method="post" action="/logout">
                <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="{{_csrf.token}}">
                <button type="submit" class="sf-btn sf-btn-ghost sf-btn-sm">로그아웃</button>
            </form>
            {{/authEnabled}}
            <a class="sf-btn sf-btn-ghost sf-btn-sm" href="/">돌아가기</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <section class="sf-settings-section">
        <h2>내 정보</h2>
        <dl class="sf-profile-list" id="profileSummary">
            <div><dt>불러오는 중…</dt><dd></dd></div>
        </dl>
        <a class="sf-btn sf-btn-ghost sf-btn-sm" href="/onboarding">프로필 수정</a>
    </section>

    <section class="sf-settings-section">
        <h2>수신 동의</h2>
        <label class="sf-switch-row">
            <span>혜택·이벤트 알림 (선택)</span>
            <input type="checkbox" class="form-check-input" id="marketingAgreed"
                   data-action="update-consent" data-consent-type="MARKETING">
        </label>
        <label class="sf-switch-row">
            <span>결제·정산 알림 (선택)</span>
            <input type="checkbox" class="form-check-input" id="notificationAgreed"
                   data-action="update-consent" data-consent-type="NOTIFICATION">
        </label>
        <p class="sf-field-hint">동의를 거부해도 서비스 이용에는 제한이 없습니다.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="sf-settings-section">
        <h2>내 데이터</h2>
        <p class="sf-field-hint">프로필, 동의 기록, 구독·결제·공유 데이터를 JSON으로 내려받습니다.</p>
        <a class="sf-btn sf-btn-ghost" href="/api/me/data" download>데이터 내려받기</a>
    </section>

    <section class="sf-settings-section sf-danger-zone">
        <h2>회원 탈퇴</h2>
        <p class="sf-field-hint">탈퇴하면 구독·결제·공유·동의 데이터가 즉시 파기됩니다.</p>
        <div class="sf-delete-row">
            <input type="text" class="form-control" id="deleteConfirmation" placeholder='확인을 위해 "탈퇴"를 입력하세요'>
            <button type="button" class="sf-btn sf-btn-danger" data-action="delete-account">탈퇴</button>
        </div>
    </section>

    <div class="sf-error d-none" id="settingsError" role="alert"></div>
</main>

<script src="/js/http.js?v=20261125r"></script>
<script src="/js/settings.js?v=20261125r"></script>
</body>
</html>
